<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>모바일 신분증</title>
<style>
  body {
    background:#e9ecef;
    font-family:sans-serif;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    height:100vh;
  }

  .card {
    width:300px;
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:20px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    text-align:center;
  }

  .profile {
    width:100px;
    height:120px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:10px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin:10px 0;
  }

  .info {
    font-size:14px;
    text-align:left;
    margin-top:10px;
  }

  .bar {
    height:6px;
    background:linear-gradient(to right, blue, purple);
    margin-top:15px;
    border-radius:5px;
  }

  .btn {
    margin-top:20px;
    background:black;
    color:white;
    padding:10px;
    border-radius:10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <img class="profile" src="https://via.placeholder.com/100x120">

  <h2>홍길동</h2>

  <div class="info">
    010101 - 1234567<br>
    서울특별시 어딘가<br>
    2026.12.31
  </div>

  <div class="bar"></div>

  <div class="btn">QR정보 표시</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
